### Single Product Usage Examples
### 
### This file demonstrates how products behave when used as singles
### vs products that support box/piece conversion

@base_url = https://localhost:7294/api/products
@jwt_token = YOUR_JWT_TOKEN_HERE

### 1. Create a SINGLE-ONLY product (no box specifications)
POST {{base_url}}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{jwt_token}}

{
    "nameEn": "Premium Olive Oil",
    "nameFa": "روغن زیتون درجه یک",
    "brandEn": "Mediterranean Gold",
    "brandFa": "طلای مدیترانه",
    "productType": 2,
    "sizeValue": 500,
    "unitType": 2,
    "baseUnit": 2,
    "price": 25.99,
    "codes": ["OIL-500ML"],
    "piecesPerBox": null,
    "boxUnit": null,
    "boxDescription": null
}

### 2. Create a FLEXIBLE product (supports both single and box)
POST {{base_url}}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{jwt_token}}

{
    "nameEn": "Energy Drink",
    "nameFa": "نوشیدنی انرژی زا",
    "brandEn": "PowerBoost",
    "brandFa": "پاور بوست",
    "productType": 2,
    "sizeValue": 250,
    "unitType": 4,
    "baseUnit": 4,
    "price": 2.50,
    "codes": ["ENERGY-250ML"],
    "piecesPerBox": 12,
    "boxUnit": 6,
    "boxWeight": 3.2,
    "boxDescription": "12 cans per box"
}

### 3. Try to convert single-only product (should fail gracefully)
POST {{base_url}}/convert-units
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{jwt_token}}

{
    "productId": 1,
    "quantity": 5,
    "fromUnit": 4,
    "toUnit": 6
}

### 4. Convert flexible product: 1 piece to boxes
POST {{base_url}}/convert-units
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{jwt_token}}

{
    "productId": 2,
    "quantity": 1,
    "fromUnit": 4,
    "toUnit": 6
}

### 5. Convert flexible product: 25 pieces to boxes (partial box)
POST {{base_url}}/convert-units
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{jwt_token}}

{
    "productId": 2,
    "quantity": 25,
    "fromUnit": 4,
    "toUnit": 6
}

### 6. Convert flexible product: 2.5 boxes to pieces
POST {{base_url}}/convert-units
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{jwt_token}}

{
    "productId": 2,
    "quantity": 2.5,
    "fromUnit": 6,
    "toUnit": 4
}

### 7. Get single-only product details
GET {{base_url}}/1
Authorization: Bearer {{jwt_token}}

### 8. Get flexible product details
GET {{base_url}}/2
Authorization: Bearer {{jwt_token}}
